    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Speed is Survival</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fine-tuned movement system enables precise and agile movement. With hordes of enemies targeting you from all directions and perilous falls around every corner, a well-timed slide or grapple can mean the difference between life and death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2468230/extras/6d768d68acd467f1bb9243fbe31b4bd3.poster.avif?t=1747266323\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2468230/extras/6d768d68acd467f1bb9243fbe31b4bd3.webm?t=1747266323\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2468230/extras/6d768d68acd467f1bb9243fbe31b4bd3.mp4?t=1747266323\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Defeat Powerful Foes</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face uniquely designed enemies with powerful weapons. Whether you\u2019re cracking skulls with the revolver or mowing down groups with the SMG, there\u2019s always a new way to lay waste to your robotic adversaries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2468230/extras/1800733cddadf675e50201813cb34bfd.poster.avif?t=1747266323\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2468230/extras/1800733cddadf675e50201813cb34bfd.webm?t=1747266323\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2468230/extras/1800733cddadf675e50201813cb34bfd.mp4?t=1747266323\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Upgrade and Adapt</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase new upgrades and weapons in the shop. Fine tune your kit to suit your playstyle or experiment with a new arsenal for a fresh run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2468230/extras/cf154b766f0923c3ef798b6673c24158.poster.avif?t=1747266323\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2468230/extras/cf154b766f0923c3ef798b6673c24158.webm?t=1747266323\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2468230/extras/cf154b766f0923c3ef798b6673c24158.mp4?t=1747266323\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Speed is Survival</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fine-tuned movement system enables precise and agile movement. With hordes of enemies targeting you from all directions and perilous falls around every corner, a well-timed slide or grapple can mean the difference between life and death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2468230/extras/6d768d68acd467f1bb9243fbe31b4bd3.poster.avif?t=1747266323\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2468230/extras/6d768d68acd467f1bb9243fbe31b4bd3.webm?t=1747266323\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2468230/extras/6d768d68acd467f1bb9243fbe31b4bd3.mp4?t=1747266323\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Defeat Powerful Foes</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face uniquely designed enemies with powerful weapons. Whether you\u2019re cracking skulls with the revolver or mowing down groups with the SMG, there\u2019s always a new way to lay waste to your robotic adversaries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2468230/extras/1800733cddadf675e50201813cb34bfd.poster.avif?t=1747266323\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2468230/extras/1800733cddadf675e50201813cb34bfd.webm?t=1747266323\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2468230/extras/1800733cddadf675e50201813cb34bfd.mp4?t=1747266323\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Upgrade and Adapt</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase new upgrades and weapons in the shop. Fine tune your kit to suit your playstyle or experiment with a new arsenal for a fresh run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2468230/extras/cf154b766f0923c3ef798b6673c24158.poster.avif?t=1747266323\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2468230/extras/cf154b766f0923c3ef798b6673c24158.webm?t=1747266323\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2468230/extras/cf154b766f0923c3ef798b6673c24158.mp4?t=1747266323\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Jump, grapple, slide and swing your way through a flying convoy, fending off bandit gangs with a deadly arsenal of unique weapons and upgrades. Challenging, fast-paced parkour mechanics and unique gunplay deliver a roguelike experience unlike any other.",
